.TH NETWORK-MONITOR 1 "2026-11-07" "Network Monitor 1.0.8" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
network-monitor \- per-application network monitor for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B network-monitor
.RB [ \-\-hidden ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Network Monitor
shows live download and upload speeds for each application by reading native
Netlink counters.  It lists active connections, executable paths, session
totals, and monthly and daily usage.  Selected applications can be blocked with
cgroup v2 and nftables through a polkit-authenticated helper.
.PP
The interface is available in English and Arabic and supports right-to-left
layouts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-hidden
Start minimized to the system tray when tray support is available and the
minimize-to-tray option is enabled.
.TP
.B \-\-collector
Run the headless usage collector instead of the graphical interface.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/network-monitor/config.json
User preferences.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/network-monitor/usage.db
Monthly and daily usage database.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/network-monitor/blocklist.json
Persistent blocklist.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.networkmonitor.helper.policy
PolicyKit action used by the privileged blocking helper.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nft (8),
.BR pkexec (1)
.SH AUTHOR
AL-Asem Software By Asem Shahen.
